OL,3,GNEWSABid for UK Town of Culture
OL,4,Awithdrawn over 'potential disaster for
OL,5,Acommunity relations'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA competition that is supposed to
OL,8,Fcelebrate local towns has been rejected
OL,9,Fby a council after it caused "great
OL,10,Fdivision" over its UK title.
OL,12,FThe mainly-nationalist town of Strabane
OL,13,Fin County Tyrone was announced as one
OL,14,Fof the 15 locations for the inaugural
OL,15,FUK Town of Culture 2028, with the
OL,16,Fchance to win #3m.
OL,18,FHowever, the local council voted not to
OL,19,Fgo ahead with the bid on Wednesday with
OL,20,Fone councillor claiming it "has the
OL,21,Fpotential to be a disaster for Strabane
OL,22,F- for community relations".
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
